Every primary-care-clinician may integrate a psychosocial-therapy-element.
A psychosocial-therapy-example is a cognitive-behavioral-therapy-example.
Every cognitive-behavioral-therapy can address a psychosocial-pain-contributor and can improve a function.
Every primary-care-clinician may encourage an active-care-plan-role for a patient.
Every primary-care-clinician may support a beneficial-activity-engagement for a patient.
A beneficial-activity-example is an exercise-example.
Every exercise can typically benefit a patient and can possibly relate to an initial-pain-exacerbation-fear.
Every primary-care-clinician may provide a relaxation-technique-education to a patient.
Every primary-care-clinician may provide a coping-strategy-education to a patient.
